            "type": "game",
            "name": "Void Memory",
            "steam_appid": 727510,
            "required_age": "12",
            "is_free": true,
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727510/extras/9b64518219218f09503bc3c9f60977ad.avif?t=1742634369\" width=620 height=100 /></span><br><strong>Void Memory</strong> is a battle-focused side-scrolling 2D action platformer. Explore several areas, gather various items and fight many kinds of enemy to test your limits. Perhaps you would be turned down due to many failures. Strict observation, analysis and preparation are the key to defeat your enemy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727510/extras/da2f1132c3c9deeb69ac150d9514d7a0.avif?t=1742634369\" width=620 height=100 /></span><br>You, who was born in a world full of darkness, should wander this hollowed land to find the Relics for a person who created you. However, fallen and lost souls with trap-filled trials await in your course of doing so. Can you survive in this crumbling world and start a new era?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727510/extras/725cf005373a432c5148895b4f2dddf1.avif?t=1742634369\" width=620 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2D platformer with original graphics<br></li><li>Unrelenting and tense battles<br></li><li>Collect various items from special enemies and exploration<br></li><li>4 equipment categories for your own strategy<br></li><li>14 regions, bosses and minibosses<br></li><li>Unlockable hard mode with stronger enemies</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727510/extras/9b64518219218f09503bc3c9f60977ad.avif?t=1742634369\" width=620 height=100 /></span><br><strong>Void Memory</strong> is a battle-focused side-scrolling 2D action platformer. Explore several areas, gather various items and fight many kinds of enemy to test your limits. Perhaps you would be turned down due to many failures. Strict observation, analysis and preparation are the key to defeat your enemy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727510/extras/da2f1132c3c9deeb69ac150d9514d7a0.avif?t=1742634369\" width=620 height=100 /></span><br>You, who was born in a world full of darkness, should wander this hollowed land to find the Relics for a person who created you. However, fallen and lost souls with trap-filled trials await in your course of doing so. Can you survive in this crumbling world and start a new era?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727510/extras/725cf005373a432c5148895b4f2dddf1.avif?t=1742634369\" width=620 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2D platformer with original graphics<br></li><li>Unrelenting and tense battles<br></li><li>Collect various items from special enemies and exploration<br></li><li>4 equipment categories for your own strategy<br></li><li>14 regions, bosses and minibosses<br></li><li>Unlockable hard mode with stronger enemies</li></ul>",
